(7605573, 1229666, 100831, '<td valign="top">If you say it''s soft, then soft is perfect for this. What a gorgeous photograph... the colors, that shadow, the face, the little hands... wow. Fabulous candid photography IMO.</td>', 'If you say it''s soft, then soft is perfect for this. What a gorgeous photograph... the colors, that shadow, the face, the little hands... wow. Fabulous candid photography IMO.', '2018-12-13 11:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
