(7605729, 1229629, 173844, '<td valign="top">Big Congratulations!  Also one of your nines.  This is beautiful and timeless, a pillow, a dream that we''re so fortunate is real and accessible.  A soft focus that dazzles and fulfills.  Then why is it only a nine?  Perhaps a numbness of spirit that couldn''t let it entirely in, but now that''s dissipated.  If you''d entered this in the Glitter Challenge, the snow on the mountain would be much more than sufficient.  All in all, thank you.</td>', 'Big Congratulations!  Also one of your nines.  This is beautiful and timeless, a pillow, a dream that we''re so fortunate is real and accessible.  A soft focus that dazzles and fulfills.  Then why is it only a nine?  Perhaps a numbness of spirit that couldn''t let it entirely in, but now that''s dissipated.  If you''d entered this in the Glitter Challenge, the snow on the mountain would be much more than sufficient.  All in all, thank you.', '2018-12-17 08:13:33.000000', NULL, 0),
